# Prototype work

New work is a new folder under `src/prototypes/`, plus one `{ name, label }` entry in `src/router.js`. `name` matches the folder.

Do not modify these unless Ted explicitly allows it:

- `src/prototypes/analytics-gpt/`
- `src/prototypes/launchpad/`
- `src/prototypes/ai-chatbot/`
- `src/prototypes/scorecards/`

Match behavior from `https://tedgoas.github.io/sizzle-reel/prototypes/<name>` or the source folder before inventing UI.

After UI edits, check `http://127.0.0.1:5173/sizzle-reel/prototypes/<name>` and exercise the interaction. A blank page after a new route usually means Vite started before the route existed. Restart it, then check branch and port.

If `src/prototypes/<name>/CLAUDE.md` exists, read it before editing that prototype.

Longer contract: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). Workflow: `.cursor/skills/new-prototype`.
